<td>Codex CLI</td>
<td>385 vs 383 /445</td>
<td><strong>−39%</strong></td>
<td><strong>−46%</strong> (18.5K vs 34.3K)</td>
<td>415s vs 437s</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="benchmarks/terminal-bench-2.1/#claude-opus-5-vs-claude-code">2026-08-25</a></td>
<td>Claude Opus 5 · <code>k=1</code></td>
<td>Claude Code</td>
<td>79 vs 77 /89</td>
<td><strong>−19%</strong></td>
