<td>610s vs 708s</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>The 2026-10-15 run is the first full run with the
<a href="docs/auto-reasoning-effort.md">effort judge</a> active on OpenAI routes, with web
search on for both sides. It is a single pass, so the <code>k=5</code> chart above stays
the reference.</p>
</details>

